HNSON - SOLDIER OF FORTUNE TURNED MASTER BUILDER!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At <strong>RETROA RETROA</strong>, the agency so good they named it twice, he crafts high-stakes training simulations. But he’s drowning in unfinished levels! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission?</strong> Jump in, test his wild creations, and help him clear the backlog! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time to BUILD. Time to CONQUER. Be a RETROA RETROA BUILDA!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421880/extras/105d742b61d8388b8e8b200884e1c1a0.avif?t=1741612101\" width=576 height=360 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421880/extras/ab46d2053ab12fdf79e630f16456523e.avif?t=1741612101\" width=576 height=372 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE SLIMES TRUST YOU… BUT THEY CAN NEVER KNOW.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They’re trapped, desperate to escape, they dream of freedom. - but the dungeon level's never end. They must NEVER know. Drop blocks, guide them upward, and <strong>never</strong> let them lose hope! The more lives you have, the harder it gets. One left? Easy… until one mistake <strong>seals their fate!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Help them climb. Help them believe. Even if they’ll never leave.</strong> </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_i